Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.16,0:00:18.83,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hanekawa mentioned that you were living in a luxurious house, Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.41,0:00:25.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My mom got immersed in a cult.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.77,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,All the valuables in our house were given to them.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.77,0:00:31.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,She also incurred a huge debt.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.72,0:00:36.26,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Therefore, my parents voluntarily divorced toward the end of last year.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.26,0:00:41.04,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My father has custody of me, and we have both lived here since then.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:37.06,0:02:38.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Are you going to help me?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.55,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I won't help you. I will, however, lend you my powers.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:45.42,0:02:48.37,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Oh, and please make a trip home.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.37,0:02:53.25,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,When you get there, I ask that you cleanse your body with holy water and change into a set of pure clothes.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:53.25,0:02:57.94,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Does meeting me back here around midnight sound all right?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.94,0:02:59.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can do that, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:03.67,0:03:04.88,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,And the reward?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.26,0:03:08.10,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.84,0:03:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not saying you'll help me for free, are you?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.43,0:03:21.55,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Well... if it makes you feel better, I guess I can charge you.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.58,0:03:25.88,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,How does 100,000 yen sound?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.52,0:03:27.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,100,000 yen.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You treat her extremely differently from how you treated me.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.70,0:03:31.85,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.85,0:03:34.94,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,As I recall, the price I quoted for the class representative was also 100,000 yen.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.78,0:03:38.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You asked me for a whopping 5,000,000 yen!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.49,0:03:40.72,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But that was a vampire, you know. It couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.72,0:03:43.57,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't blame anything and everything on the vampire!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.07,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Can you pay?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.45,0:03:47.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.37,0:03:49.91,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No matter what I might have to do.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:52.41,0:03:53.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:00.52,0:04:01.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,100,000 yen, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.83,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I've finished taking a shower.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.17,0:04:10.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Could you get out of the way?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get to my clothes.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Clothes! Put on your clothes!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.97,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:16.97,0:04:19.85,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm saying that you should have put something on before you stepped out!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.85,0:04:22.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I forgot to carry them in with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then at least cover yourself with a towel or something!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.61,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't want to do something that a poor person would do!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.12,0:04:37.83,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The first time that I've seen a girl completely nude...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.45,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Pure clothes, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he'd prefer white clothing?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.12,0:04:42.96,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.66,0:04:50.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't have any bras or panties that don't have patterns.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.21,0:04:52.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.35,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.35,0:04:59.27,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You haven't gotten aroused from seeing me nude, have you?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.69,0:05:02.96,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even if I have, it wouldn't be my fault!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.96,0:05:05.49,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Done. You can turn around.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.27,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see. Seriously...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.26,0:05:13.25,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What's your motive?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.46,0:05:17.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This is a special service as a reward for today.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You should at least be happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.62,0:05:22.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Be a little bit happy, will you?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.66,0:05:23.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I should be getting mad.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You should at least give me a critique as a courtesy.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.74,0:05:29.14,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,A critique...?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.03,0:05:34.07,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Y-You have a nice figure... How's that?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.75,0:05:36.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Terrible.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.93,0:05:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exactly why you will forever be a virgin.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:40.09,0:05:41.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Forever?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.08,0:05:43.32,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Did you come from the future?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.24,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Please refrain from spitting.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be infected by your virginity.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:46.93,0:05:49.07,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Like a man's virginity could spread to a woman!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.24,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hold up... Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.24,0:05:55.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The topic is proceeding on the assumption that I am a virgin.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:56.19,0:05:58.07,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's true that my words are biased.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm glad you realize that.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Just don't spit.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your amateurish virginity will infect me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.66,0:06:05.30,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I admit it.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} a virgin!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.00,0:06:10.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.72,0:06:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep this a secret from Hanekawa-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.75,0:06:14.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why her?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:15.18,0:06:18.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Isn't she the girl you have a crush on?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:18.43,0:06:19.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You guys talk frequently, don't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.29,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's incorrect.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.29,0:06:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just because Hanekawa is honestly the type that looks after others.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.45,0:06:26.91,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,"The most useless people are pitiful."
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.91,0:06:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"They will definitely be used."
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She always has such amusing misconceptions.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.28,0:06:33.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That sure is an amusing misconception, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.96,0:06:36.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even though the most useless people are just the most foolish.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.01,0:06:39.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, I didn't say that much.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It was written all over your face.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.37,0:06:41.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No it wasn't.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.68,0:06:44.04,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Having predicted that you'd say that, I already wrote it on your face.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.04,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No way in hell are you that well prepared!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.04,0:06:54.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san was also helped by Oshino-san before as well, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.86,0:06:56.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You could say that, I guess.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.77,0:07:00.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's why I think he's more or less trustworthy.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.47,0:07:02.07,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's not just my testimony.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.07,0:07:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa says so, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.20,0:07:04.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.37,0:07:07.26,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,However, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.42,0:07:15.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If I could believe him that easily, I would have been tricked countless times.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.25,0:07:20.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's why I can never have such optimistic thoughts.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.46,0:07:28.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You took the time to put it on; why remove it?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I forgot to dry my hair.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.35,0:07:34.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You... Could it be that you're just an idiot?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.27,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Please don't speak such rude words.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You could hurt my feelings.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.82,0:07:46.35,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You mentioned optimism just now, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:46.35,0:07:47.71,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Isn't that how it goes?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.94,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.94,0:07:52.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But being optimistic isn't a bad thing, is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.65,0:07:54.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's not like you're doing anything bad.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.39,0:07:55.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's also not like you're cheating either.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.69,0:07:59.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Not doing anything bad, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:00.15,0:08:00.66,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Isn't that so?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.11,0:08:02.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.41,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.29,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It may be considered a form of cheating.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.29,0:08:06.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:07.43,0:08:08.04,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Say, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.80,0:08:14.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.57,0:08:18.05,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What did you mean when you said it's comparable to the pattern on the moon?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:18.05,0:08:19.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.76,0:08:22.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that to Oshino-san back then?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oh, {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.08,0:08:27.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It is said that when you see the moon in Japan, its patterns resemble rabbits pounding rice cakes.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.82,0:08:32.07,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Whereas abroad, a crab or a beautiful woman can be seen.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:32.37,0:08:34.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you know such useless things.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.80,0:08:39.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This is the first time since birth that I've admired you.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.98,0:08:40.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:40.92,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just familiar with astronomy and cosmology.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.33,0:08:44.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to act cool in front of me.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.66,0:08:50.45,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Besides, you don't know about anything else, do you?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.45,0:08:52.37,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Are you aware of what verbal abuse is?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.37,0:08:55.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You should tell that to the police officer in charge of verbal abuse.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.22,0:08:57.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.38,0:09:00.87,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You only want to show me that proud body of yours.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.87,0:09:02.45,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Proud body of mine?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.45,0:09:03.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm not that arrogant.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.43,0:09:06.68,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm just not used to wearing clothes.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,They're heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.71,0:09:12.77,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But I didn't think you would be so knowledgeable, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.77,0:09:14.16,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.16,0:09:18.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It might actually be possible that there is a brain inside your head.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.12,0:09:18.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's obvious.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.27,0:09:20.45,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Obvious?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:20.73,0:09:25.25,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A creature like you having a brain residing in his skull...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.60,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,...is already a miracle in and of itself.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.60,0:09:31.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You... think I am really stupid, don't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.83,0:09:33.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You're actually expressing genuine shock!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.26,0:09:43.49,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because of my carelessness, Araragi-kun realized that his brain is slower than others'.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.49,0:09:44.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I feel so guilty.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.72,0:09:46.62,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.62,0:09:49.68,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Is my stupidity level really that grave?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.68,0:09:52.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My standardized test score is seventy-four.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.37,0:09:54.69,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Mine's forty-six...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.69,0:09:56.40,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,When rounded, it becomes zero.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.84,0:09:57.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.38,0:09:58.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Liar. Forty-six would round up to...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.82,0:10:02.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, you rounded from the tens place!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.97,0:10:05.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How could you do that to my standardized test score?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.47,0:10:06.20,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,One hundred.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.20,0:10:08.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can't grasp the sense of victory without expanding the difference.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You also rounded your own score from the tens place...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.20,0:10:14.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.71,0:10:19.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If everything goes well, let's visit Hokkaido to eat crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:19.87,0:10:22.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that would be fine...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.31,0:10:23.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You will be going as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:23.51,0:10:24.53,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.89,0:10:26.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Ah, don't you know?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:27.75,0:10:30.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Crab is very delicious.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.88,0:11:03.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oshino-san, you were a priest?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.92,0:11:09.64,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even though it was my specialization in university, I have not been employed by any shrine.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.64,0:11:11.90,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I thought over a lot of things.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:13.29,0:11:16.19,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You look like you've been purified nicely, miss.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.19,0:11:17.53,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It is quite well done.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.07,0:11:21.27,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Just to confirm, are you wearing make-up?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:21.27,0:11:24.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I thought it best not to, hence I did not put any on.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:24.12,0:11:24.97,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:24.97,0:11:27.31,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Your judgment is correct.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:27.31,0:11:29.56,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Has Araragi-kun taken a shower?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.56,0:11:31.75,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I took a shower at Senjougahara's place.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:34.55,0:11:36.19,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You still haven't improved, have you?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.19,0:11:37.96,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't say such unnecessary things.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:41.74,0:11:42.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,By the way, Oshino...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.97,0:11:46.22,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Is this crab or whatever easy to exorcise?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.46,0:11:49.85,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Your way of thinking is really violent, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.30,0:11:52.83,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Did anything good happen?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:52.83,0:11:58.87,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Shinobu-chan and that nymphomaniac cat attacked you and that class representative out of malice...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.87,0:12:01.23,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,But that's not the case with the crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.23,0:12:02.24,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.09,0:12:06.03,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Didn't I say that the opponent is a god?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:06.03,0:12:08.24,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,As such, we are not going to exorcise it.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.24,0:12:11.49,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Starting now, we are going to pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:11.81,0:12:13.41,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Your attitudes must be respectful.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.41,0:12:16.78,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Is it something that can be returned if prayed for?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.78,0:12:17.75,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara's...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.64,0:12:19.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,weight.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.67,0:12:20.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Body mass.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.95,0:12:21.96,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Maybe?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.31,0:12:26.80,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,They are not so stubborn as to reject desperate wishes from humans.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.80,0:12:30.94,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Though, gods are a bunch of careless beings.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.94,0:12:32.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Careless, as in?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.78,0:12:35.88,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,They don't care about the personal problems of humans.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.88,0:12:41.07,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,In fact, gods can't even differentiate between the age, gender, or weight of the three of us.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.48,0:12:46.19,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hey, is that crab still beside me?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.50,0:12:50.03,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's still right beside you.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.03,0:12:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's also everywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.80,0:12:56.05,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,If you want to summon it, you need to follow step-by-step procedures.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.25,0:13:08.13,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Both of you, look down at the floor.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.13,0:13:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your heads down.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:09.70,0:13:10.48,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.48,0:13:12.60,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,This place is already right in front of the god.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.22,0:13:28.39,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.39,0:13:33.80,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Drinking sake seems to be able to shorten the distance to gods.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.80,0:13:35.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm underage.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.12,0:13:38.63,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It's not like you're drinking till you drop. Just take a sip.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.22,0:13:49.19,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Okay, you two.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.19,0:13:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start by relaxing.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:53.22,0:13:55.38,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,This position belongs to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.38,0:13:57.77,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You're standing in your rightful position.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.05,0:13:59.77,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.97,0:14:03.89,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Close your eyes while continuing to tilt your head.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.89,0:14:05.19,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Begin counting.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.15,0:14:11.86,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:11.86,0:14:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:16.86,0:14:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:18.47,0:14:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.87,0:14:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:23.55,0:14:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.85,0:14:29.13,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Have you calmed down?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.93,0:14:30.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.78,0:14:33.68,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,All right, then answer my questions.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.54,0:14:37.68,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Miss, what is your name?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.28,0:14:39.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara Hitagi.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.31,0:14:41.69,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What is the name of the school that you're attending?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.19,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Naoetsu Private High School.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.60,0:14:45.44,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,When is your birthday?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.31,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,July 7th.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.57,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Who is your favorite novelist?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.45,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yumeno Kyuusaku. {Note: A surrealist Japanese author.}
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.94,0:14:54.45,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Could you tell us about an experience of failure you had as a child?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.89,0:14:56.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't want to reveal that.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.50,0:14:57.95,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,What is your favorite classical music?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:58.52,0:15:00.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm not very interested in music.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:00.46,0:15:03.34,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,How did you feel when you graduated from elementary school?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.79,0:15:07.29,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I took it as nothing more than a transfer to middle school.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.29,0:15:09.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I simply moved from one public school to another.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:09.59,0:15:11.89,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,What type of person was your first love?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.32,0:15:13.39,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't want to reveal that.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.89,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Up till now, what has been your most painful memory?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.17,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.05,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Your most painful memory...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.05,0:15:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm asking is that you recall your worst memory.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.90,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,M-My mother...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:30.76,0:15:31.78,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Your mother?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:32.79,0:15:35.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,She got immersed in a cult.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.29,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.41,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What do you mean "is that all?"
Dialogue: 4,0:15:40.28,0:15:41.79,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.79,0:15:43.04,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.68,0:15:49.30,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A-A high-ranking cult member came to my house.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.89,0:15:52.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My mom brought him there.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.87,0:15:54.68,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Brought him there... What happened next?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.71,0:15:56.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,He claimed that it was a ritual...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.15,0:15:59.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.27,0:16:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.37,0:16:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...was violated.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.59,0:16:10.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,He... attempted to rape me.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.29,0:16:12.49,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:13.19,0:16:17.70,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You said that he {\i1}attempted{\i0} to rape you, meaning it didn't happen?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.84,0:16:21.64,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I used a spiked shoe beside me to hit him.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:22.63,0:16:27.29,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But... my mom did not come to my rescue.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:28.33,0:16:29.05,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,After that?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:30.16,0:16:35.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because I injured the high-ranking cult member, my mom was...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:36.55,0:16:39.72,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Your mom was punished, correct?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:40.65,0:16:41.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.96,0:16:44.14,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But I always find myself thinking about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:44.14,0:16:51.88,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If I hadn't resisted at that time, maybe my mother wouldn't have fallen into such a pathetic state.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:51.88,0:16:54.25,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then our relationship would not have been broken.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.25,0:16:58.31,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Then, miss, those are your feelings.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.74,0:17:03.30,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,No matter how heavy they are, they are things you must carry with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.30,0:17:05.50,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You can't push them onto someone else.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.70,0:17:08.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Pushing them onto someone else...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:09.25,0:17:10.97,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Without looking away...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:10.97,0:17:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes and take a look.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:26.46,0:17:28.63,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Can you see anything?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.58,0:17:32.07,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's the same as that time.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:32.61,0:17:34.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The same as that time.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.33,0:17:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:36.44,0:17:38.07,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can see a crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:39.63,0:17:40.80,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:40.80,0:17:42.97,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.97,0:17:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.75,0:17:46.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.28,0:17:50.54,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But I see it very clearly.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.02,0:17:52.17,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Is that so? Then...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:53.16,0:17:55.67,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Then... isn't there something you need to say?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.30,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Something I need to say?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:09.31,0:18:10.56,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.53,0:18:21.40,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.89,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Seriously, what an impatient god.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.27,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It's an energetic fellow, I must say.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:28.69,0:18:30.32,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, Oshino!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.32,0:18:31.56,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of plans.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:33.04,0:18:33.63,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I have to do this now.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:34.44,0:18:37.13,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.20,0:18:50.38,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,In the end, this is still a question of self-reflection.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:50.38,0:18:53.46,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,If praying does not work, and words are ineffective...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.36,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,...what's left is to fight.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.66,0:18:56.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.75,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Regardless, if it's disposed of like that...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.75,0:19:01.39,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,...according to procedure, this problem will be solved.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:01.39,0:19:03.58,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,For this case, I say that's one possible solution.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.31,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,A possible solution?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.31,0:19:07.91,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I generally hate crabs...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.31,0:19:09.54,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,...because they're hard to eat.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:11.14,0:19:11.79,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.39,0:19:15.30,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Please wait, Oshino-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.50,0:19:17.91,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Wait?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.91,0:19:19.84,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Wait for what, miss?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:20.03,0:19:23.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Just now, I was merely frightened.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.77,0:19:26.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I will do this properly.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:26.67,0:19:28.85,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:30.28,0:19:31.55,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Then help yourself.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:32.05,0:19:32.72,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Give it a try.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.42,0:19:42.07,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,And... thank you very much.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:43.21,0:19:45.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But you've done enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:45.22,0:19:50.23,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because those are my thoughts, my feelings, and my memories.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I will carry them myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,They are things that I should not have lost.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:56.93,0:19:59.94,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I beg you, may I...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.94,0:20:02.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,May I please have my weight back?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.88,0:20:06.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,May I please have my mother back?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.52,0:20:21.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It seems that when Senjougahara's mother got immersed in the cult,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:21.46,0:20:24.85,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara was a fifth grader.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:25.43,0:20:28.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She had a serious illness at that time.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:30.00,0:20:35.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Because of her daughter's illness, Senjougahara's mother wanted to seek spiritual assurance.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.79,0:20:36.33,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.06,0:20:42.30,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,...Senjougahara managed to survive a major surgical operation.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:43.20,0:20:47.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But her mother became increasingly immersed in the cult.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.18,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,After that, the relationship between Senjougahara and her mother became strained.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:52.18,0:20:55.52,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It seems that she stopped talking to her mother during her middle school years.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:55.88,0:20:56.69,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.69,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Just before graduation from middle school, an incident occurred.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This resulted in...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:14.26,0:21:16.15,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,...the breaking up of the family.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:17.37,0:21:18.33,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It became irreparable.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:19.29,0:21:24.22,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It was then that Senjougahara met a crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:26.63,0:21:29.41,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,A weight crab... That sort of thing, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.41,0:21:32.72,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,is also called an emotion god. {Note: This is word play on Omoshi Kani (Weight Crab) and Omoishi Kami (Emotion God).}
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.72,0:21:37.23,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Also, a bond is formed through a combination of feelings and protection. {Note: More word play. Omoi (feelings) and Shigami (protection) becomes Shigarami (a bond).}
Dialogue: 4,0:21:38.00,0:21:40.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That is to say, when Senjougahara met the crab,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:40.84,0:21:46.71,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,she cut all ties to her mother so she could stop feeling troubled regarding such matters.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.71,0:21:49.71,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She stopped thinking about those feelings, and therefore lost weight. {Note: More word play. "Omoi" can mean both "weight" and "feelings."}
Dialogue: 4,0:21:50.24,0:21:52.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She chose to cheat herself.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.87,0:21:56.86,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It actually isn't such a bad thing.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:56.86,0:22:00.70,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,This case especially, since even if she gets her feelings back,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:00.70,0:22:05.26,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,her mother won't come back and the family will remain broken.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.51,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even then, even so...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:07.93,0:22:11.63,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Because of that, Senjougahara Hitagi wanted to take them back.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:11.63,0:22:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She begged to get them back.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.22,0:22:17.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Those unbearable feelings of her mother, memories, and frustrations.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.94,0:22:21.16,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Like what Oshino said, maybe nothing will change.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:22.66,0:22:25.03,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's not like nothing can be changed.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.46,0:22:28.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Besides, it isn't a futile effort.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.42,0:22:31.91,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,At least I gained an important friend.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:32.36,0:22:33.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Who are you referring to?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:34.95,0:22:35.91,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:37.24,0:22:39.45,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Thank you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.45,0:22:42.16,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.16,0:22:44.63,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I apologize for all my actions up till now.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.99,0:22:50.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even though saying such a thing now is shameless, if we can get along from now on...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.42,0:22:51.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'll be very happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:57.32,0:22:58.94,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,All right brother, it's morning now!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:58.94,0:23:01.35,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,It's about time you woke up.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:01.35,0:23:03.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I just went to sleep...
Dialogue: 4,0:23:03.61,0:23:06.44,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Oh, you were out all night, again?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:06.44,0:23:07.40,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.50,0:23:10.16,Default,Tsukihi,0,0,0,,You're the only person who hasn't had breakfast yet, brother.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:09.24,0:23:10.16,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,That's right, bro—
Dialogue: 4,0:23:12.46,0:23:14.69,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}But still, my body feels heavy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:23:14.69,0:23:15.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do I have a fever or something?{\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:23:17.56,0:23:18.40,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might as well mention it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:23:18.40,0:23:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My weight is 55 Kg.{\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:23:20.94,0:23:21.37,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...{\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:23:21.72,0:23:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:23.23,0:23:24.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:23:24.19,0:23:27.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gods really are careless creatures. {\i0}
Dialogue: 4,0:25:00.93,0:25:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:01.58,0:25:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:02.47,0:25:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When you say jungle-gyms nowadays...
Dialogue: 4,0:25:03.64,0:25:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've said it before!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:04.51,0:25:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you've said too much.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:05.72,0:25:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:06.18,0:25:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "jungle"?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:06.97,0:25:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a jungle.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:08.06,0:25:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What about gym?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:08.68,0:25:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a gym either.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:09.31,0:25:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's false advertisement!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:10.35,0:25:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then can they name it so you can be happy?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:11.77,0:25:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe something like "Despair Special"?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:13.44,0:25:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's seriously sounds pretty bad!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:14.27,0:25:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once again, let's start the preview riddle.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:15.57,0:25:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Riddle.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:16.27,0:25:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a bus driver.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:17.61,0:25:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm the bus driver!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:19.36,0:25:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us rode it in the first episode!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:20.82,0:25:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, we rode it!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:21.45,0:25:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the name of the person who drives your bus?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:23.53,0:25:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go too fast!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:24.82,0:25:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Mayoi Snail Part 1.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.83,0:25:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, the answer is your name.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:28.45,0:25:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it like a magic show.
